---
alwaysApply: true
---
When executing or resuming a story, apply the existing `AGENTS.md` and
`.cursor/skills/story-workflow/SKILL.md`. The story's one tracked plan follows
`docs/plan/TEMPLATE.md` (adapted from `doc/PLAN/REQUIREMENTS_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`).
Run `python3 scripts/check_story_plan.py <STORY-ID> --phase ready` before Build,
`--phase checkpoint` before marking a completed step, and `--phase done` at closure.
A failed check blocks that transition. These checks validate documentation
structure only, not test truth, secure behavior or SSDF compliance.
